WEBVTT

00:19:29.849 --> 00:19:32.126
OK, this is going to be
a different kind of ad.

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:35.497
I've played a personal role in selecting
the sponsors for this podcast,

00:19:35.521 --> 00:19:38.154
because they all have interesting
cultures of their own.

00:19:38.178 --> 00:19:40.409
Today, we're going
inside the workplace at SAP.

00:19:40.433 --> 00:19:43.016
(Music)

00:19:54.880 --> 00:19:57.656
Nico Neumann: We were told
to be like a calculator,

00:19:57.680 --> 00:20:00.406
just to perform basic
arithmetic operations.